<title>UK: SOCCER-RANGERS WIN NINTH SUCCESSIVE LEAGUE TITLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RANGERS WIN NINTH SUCCESSIVE LEAGUE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glasgow Rangers clinched their ninth successive Scottish league championship on Wednesday when they won 1-0 at Dundee United.</p>
<p>The only goal of the game was scored after 11 minutes by Dane Brian Laudrup and enabled Rangers to match the nine successive titles won by their great rivals Celtic from 1966 to 1974.</p>
